# Non-secret configuration for release and deployment, committed. Credentials go in .env.secret instead (see
# .env.secret.example), machine-local values in a gitignored .env.local (see .env.local.example).
#
# Nothing reads this file yet: a variable added here takes effect only once the script that needs it loads
# this file (scripts/env.mjs's loadEnv). A release-path script must not load it while it holds a `VITE_`
# entry, which vite would inline into the bundle.
